WEBVTT

00:01.090 --> 00:02.779
So, did you find Skinner?

00:02.780 --> 00:04.179
Babylonia City.

00:04.180 --> 00:05.639
At the Homeless Community.

00:05.640 --> 00:06.799
Are you kidding?

00:06.800 --> 00:08.890
That's practically right next door.

00:09.260 --> 00:10.350
[Road Closed]

00:15.240 --> 00:17.049
We're taking Hersch back.

00:17.050 --> 00:18.029
Tell me,

00:18.030 --> 00:21.099
what will I get for cooperating

00:21.100 --> 00:22.580
with your investigation?

00:22.890 --> 00:25.630
Cut the crap.

00:26.560 --> 00:28.929
Be sure to look after Skinner for me!

00:28.930 --> 00:31.530
For sure! We'll definitely find him!

00:32.750 --> 00:34.950
[See you where the Angel watches.]

01:58.640 --> 02:04.630
[LAZARUS]

02:08.020 --> 02:10.889
[See you where the Angel watches.]

02:08.389 --> 02:10.999
What a lovely invitation for a date.

02:11.000 --> 02:13.299
It's a shame you're not gonna make it.

02:13.300 --> 02:14.880
You tell me.

02:15.290 --> 02:17.420
I can't go anywhere in this condition.

02:17.610 --> 02:19.749
Where the Angel watches.

02:19.750 --> 02:21.150
Isn't that romantic?

02:21.340 --> 02:22.839
Yeah, I guess.

02:22.840 --> 02:24.659
Maybe one of us will wind up in heaven

02:24.660 --> 02:25.990
when this is all over.

02:26.579 --> 02:28.060
You mean hell, right?

02:30.230 --> 02:32.709
Yeah, I don't think I'll be leaving
anytime soon.

02:32.710 --> 02:35.030
Not unless that bed grows legs!

02:56.670 --> 02:59.659
Your INSCOM

02:59.660 --> 03:01.709
has violated international law

03:01.710 --> 03:04.560
by secretly developing biological weapons.

03:04.880 --> 03:06.329
You took Skinner's research

03:06.330 --> 03:08.280
and turned it into a deadly toxin.

03:08.850 --> 03:13.120
Then you attacked him at Schiphol Airport
when he tried to publicly leak it.

03:13.600 --> 03:16.369
And in the resulting clash
with local police,

03:16.370 --> 03:19.419
your bioweapon was dispersed into the air,

03:19.420 --> 03:21.730
which resulted in multiple casualties.

03:22.450 --> 03:25.990
But that was all swept under the rug
as a terrorist attack.

03:26.170 --> 03:27.369
One more thing

03:27.370 --> 03:28.860
I forgot to mention.

03:29.060 --> 03:30.869
The one we're here to arrest

03:30.870 --> 03:32.970
is you, Schneider.

03:34.240 --> 03:35.670
Impossible.

03:36.170 --> 03:37.500
All countries have been

03:37.790 --> 03:41.450
ignoring the Geneva Conventions
and making biological weapons.

03:41.600 --> 03:43.990
Our country has fallen way behind.

03:44.490 --> 03:47.920
Who exactly do you think would pay
for all this hypocrisy?

03:48.070 --> 03:49.439
That's not something

03:49.440 --> 03:51.570
you get to decide.

03:51.730 --> 03:55.229
Just imagine the day they use
bioweapons on our soil;

03:55.230 --> 03:58.059
the people will see us as heroes.

03:58.060 --> 04:01.739
You can save that kind of crap
for your court martial.

04:01.740 --> 04:03.439
Only if your so-called

04:03.440 --> 04:06.940
"living proof" turns out
to still be alive.

04:16.110 --> 04:18.769
I've seen the top-secret document

04:16.529 --> 04:18.839
[Warning]

04:18.790 --> 04:21.489
on the testimony about the Hundun Program.

04:21.490 --> 04:23.539
But accessing it

04:23.540 --> 04:27.089
requires the approval of
both the President's

04:27.090 --> 04:28.469
and the Secretary of State apparently.

04:28.470 --> 04:30.199
I can't get their approval right away.

04:30.200 --> 04:31.849
We're running out of time.

04:31.850 --> 04:34.679
Then I'll fabricate one.

04:34.680 --> 04:36.399
You know,

04:36.400 --> 04:39.100
that is my specialty.

04:39.610 --> 04:45.050
[Hypercube Station, Babylonia City]

04:46.840 --> 04:48.479
How's the vehicle?

04:48.480 --> 04:49.709
Perfect.

04:49.710 --> 04:50.539
Where's the car?

04:50.540 --> 04:52.140
Bringing it over right away.

04:54.830 --> 04:56.119
Abel?

04:56.120 --> 04:57.469
I'll explain later.

04:57.470 --> 04:59.220
We've found Skinner.

04:59.450 --> 05:01.060
Head over there right away.

05:01.370 --> 05:04.030
I'll be right there after we
settle things here.

05:05.870 --> 05:07.429
We're certain that Skinner is somewhere

05:07.430 --> 05:10.219
in the Homeless Community,

05:10.220 --> 05:12.370
but the area is too big.

05:10.290 --> 05:15.690
[Hersch]

05:12.400 --> 05:15.759
Is there any way to narrow his location?

05:15.760 --> 05:18.310
Like something that only Skinner
would have?

05:18.430 --> 05:20.549
He likes plants.

05:20.550 --> 05:22.710
His room used to be full of plants.

05:22.870 --> 05:26.020
But that alone hardly counts as a clue.

05:26.190 --> 05:27.699
Oh, right.

05:27.700 --> 05:29.330
That thing from back then...

05:29.840 --> 05:32.210
The Fantasy Tulips!

05:34.750 --> 05:36.770
We're in!

05:36.230 --> 05:43.440
[Warning]

05:37.110 --> 05:38.509
Well...

05:38.510 --> 05:41.589
This is the testimony record of

05:41.590 --> 05:43.629
Zhang Jianguo, former
Chinese Minister of State Security,

05:43.630 --> 05:47.009
who sought asylum in the United States.

05:47.010 --> 05:49.959
Please note, he was killed by
some unknown assassin

05:49.960 --> 05:53.220
shortly after providing the testimony.

05:53.490 --> 05:54.939
That's right.

05:54.940 --> 05:55.980
This is it.

05:56.730 --> 05:57.849
He's gone?

05:57.850 --> 05:59.679
Yeah. Can you believe it?

05:59.680 --> 06:02.629
That blows my mind so much
that I'm at a loss for words.

06:02.630 --> 06:05.729
What could he possibly accomplish
with the shape he's in?

06:05.730 --> 06:06.809
Where did he go?

06:06.810 --> 06:07.839
Probably

06:07.840 --> 06:10.450
to the place where the angel is watching.

06:11.450 --> 06:12.920
Got it.

06:13.340 --> 06:16.329
Leland, once you meet with Hersch,
head to Skinner's location.

06:16.330 --> 06:18.549
I have to go pick up an idiot.

06:18.550 --> 06:19.770
Understood.

06:21.400 --> 06:22.569
Target Alpha

06:22.570 --> 06:23.689
has been sighted.

06:23.690 --> 06:24.409
Copy.

06:24.410 --> 06:28.439
Proceeding with the operation and anticipation
of him making contact with Target Beta.

06:28.440 --> 06:29.770
Emergency alert.

06:29.930 --> 06:32.779
This is US Army INSCOM.

06:32.780 --> 06:34.259
We've received intel

06:34.260 --> 06:37.658
that terrorists are hiding inside
the Babylonia Tower.

06:37.659 --> 06:38.709
Roger.

06:38.710 --> 06:41.899
We'll coordinate with the police
and issue an evacuation order.

06:41.900 --> 06:44.700
We're also heading to the scene
by helicopter now.

06:50.820 --> 06:51.969
Attention: An emergency evacuation order

06:51.970 --> 06:53.719
has been issued for the area

06:53.720 --> 06:56.399
surrounding Babylonia Tower.

06:56.400 --> 06:58.469
Please evacuate immediately

06:58.470 --> 07:00.330
if you live in the vicinity.

07:03.170 --> 07:07.400
[Episode 13: The World Is Yours]

07:16.100 --> 07:18.930
So the wait is finally over.

07:19.220 --> 07:22.930
That's some heavy artillery
you have there.

07:23.190 --> 07:25.269
The world is literally about to end,

07:25.270 --> 07:28.350
and all you can think about is me.

07:29.730 --> 07:32.380
There's no way I can let you live.

07:32.580 --> 07:34.109
Hold on.

07:34.110 --> 07:36.569
It'll be too late to talk after I'm dead.

07:36.570 --> 07:38.880
You want to know something, don't you?

07:39.360 --> 07:41.020
The Hundun...

07:41.270 --> 07:43.399
Time for our last dance.

07:43.400 --> 07:45.250
Let's make it a good one.

07:58.740 --> 08:01.199
Yeah, that's the spirit.

08:01.200 --> 08:02.829
It says here

08:02.830 --> 08:04.819
that a secret project meant to
train assassins

08:04.820 --> 08:06.869
was carried out under the oversight

08:06.870 --> 08:09.719
of the Ministry of State Security.

08:09.720 --> 08:11.989
The project indoctrinated children

08:11.990 --> 08:14.519
from a young age to completely discard
their emotions and humanity,

08:14.520 --> 08:16.679
turning them into faceless monsters

08:16.680 --> 08:20.470
that were impossible to negotiate with.

08:21.980 --> 08:23.239
These assassins

08:23.240 --> 08:25.330
were likened to

08:24.350 --> 08:27.080
[Hundun]

08:25.350 --> 08:27.359
a faceless creature from Chinese mythology

08:27.360 --> 08:29.249
known as the Hundun.

08:29.250 --> 08:31.780
So, that's the Hundun Program.

08:35.559 --> 08:38.090
You're no longer human.

08:41.100 --> 08:43.940
You'll become a faceless monster.

08:47.200 --> 08:49.110
Rid yourself of your heart.

08:52.200 --> 08:54.600
And kill everything.

08:56.210 --> 08:57.600
[Hundun]

08:58.870 --> 09:00.499
The Hundun...

09:00.500 --> 09:03.029
had holes bored into his face.

09:03.030 --> 09:04.709
But then...

09:04.710 --> 09:06.260
what happened next?

09:23.240 --> 09:24.729
At some point,

09:24.730 --> 09:26.399
one of the assassins snapped.

09:26.400 --> 09:27.879
He killed all the other students

09:27.880 --> 09:30.549
as well as the instructor

09:30.550 --> 09:32.510
before vanishing without a trace.

09:33.160 --> 09:34.790
Good.

09:35.100 --> 09:38.859
You're this project's masterpiece.

09:38.860 --> 09:42.770
You've become a true monster,

09:42.910 --> 09:46.070
but no one can control you anymore.

09:46.400 --> 09:49.850
Because you're going to forget
everything right here.

10:17.300 --> 10:18.700
I'm over here!

11:38.490 --> 11:47.370
[LAZARUS]

12:09.040 --> 12:11.260
Hey, still alive?

12:12.400 --> 12:13.740
Let me tell you.

12:14.830 --> 12:17.520
After the Hundun had holes
bored in his face

12:17.840 --> 12:19.370
on the seventh day, he died.

12:20.890 --> 12:24.050
Ah, I just remembered.

12:26.070 --> 12:29.190
I'm no longer some kind of monster...

12:30.790 --> 12:32.240
right?

12:46.290 --> 12:47.960
How are you doing?

12:48.340 --> 12:49.730
Not bad, I guess.

12:50.380 --> 12:52.699
We're going to Skinner later.

12:52.700 --> 12:54.030
Wanna hop on?

13:00.250 --> 13:02.089
Everything's wrapped up here.

13:02.090 --> 13:03.449
And you?

13:03.450 --> 13:06.229
I clearly had a fever because of Hapna,

13:06.230 --> 13:08.029
but somehow it went away.

13:08.030 --> 13:09.609
Now, I feel totally fine.

13:09.610 --> 13:11.640
I want to know why.

13:11.830 --> 13:12.760
Right.

13:12.860 --> 13:15.590
The time has come to explain everything.

13:17.720 --> 13:18.799
Skinner was against

13:18.800 --> 13:24.159
his research being used to create
a bioweapon, but he failed to stop it.

13:24.160 --> 13:27.290
So he decided to leak the proof
of it in Europe.

13:28.210 --> 13:29.929
But then the Army found out

13:29.930 --> 13:32.289
and dispatched troops to Schiphol Airport.

13:32.290 --> 13:35.290
They ended up clashing with
the local airport police.

13:35.590 --> 13:36.909
During the shoot-out,

13:36.910 --> 13:39.949
his suitcase was damaged
and started to leak toxin,

13:39.950 --> 13:42.210
which killed many people.

13:43.050 --> 13:44.770
And everyone here—

13:44.950 --> 13:46.539
all five of you—

13:46.540 --> 13:49.070
was present at that incident.

13:49.450 --> 13:52.469
Many people lost their lives,

13:52.470 --> 13:55.199
but your DNA mutated,

13:55.200 --> 13:57.630
and you developed resistance to this drug.

13:58.120 --> 14:00.189
You all died once

14:00.190 --> 14:02.260
and then came back to life.

14:02.630 --> 14:04.550
The rising of Lazarus.

14:05.210 --> 14:08.070
That's when Skinner came up with a plan—

14:08.720 --> 14:11.219
a way to leak the existence of the drug

14:11.220 --> 14:14.610
to the world without it
ever getting covered up.

14:14.890 --> 14:16.409
And now that drug

14:16.410 --> 14:17.809
exists within the bodies

14:17.810 --> 14:19.890
of all mankind as Hapna.

14:20.590 --> 14:23.290
A problem that no one
can afford to ignore.

14:29.220 --> 14:31.699
Hersch and Leland, right?

14:31.700 --> 14:34.389
I'm Jill. I've heard about you two.

14:34.390 --> 14:35.839
I think I have

14:35.840 --> 14:37.540
a clue.

14:37.730 --> 14:39.519
That old lady's house has a flower

14:39.520 --> 14:41.979
that's the same as the one
in Skinner's house.

14:41.980 --> 14:45.760
It's a rare Fantasy Tulip.

14:46.100 --> 14:47.640
What you're talking about is

14:46.990 --> 14:50.270
[Tulipa Sprengeri]

14:47.660 --> 14:50.160
Tulipa Sprengeri, right?

14:50.360 --> 14:51.789
Could it be...

14:51.790 --> 14:53.219
I think I know!

14:53.220 --> 14:54.800
Hurry up.

15:08.020 --> 15:10.119
Ah! You're that...

15:10.120 --> 15:11.699
escaped prisoner from back then!

15:11.700 --> 15:14.650
Hey, now's not the time for that.

15:14.770 --> 15:17.089
Actually, Skinner is ahead.

15:17.090 --> 15:19.149
It'll be dangerous for you
to catch him alone.

15:19.150 --> 15:20.539
Request backup immediately,

15:20.540 --> 15:21.949
then arrest him. Can you do it?

15:21.950 --> 15:23.519
Of...

15:23.520 --> 15:24.599
of course I can.

15:24.600 --> 15:25.909
The fate of humanity

15:25.910 --> 15:27.069
depends on you!

15:27.070 --> 15:28.159
Hurry and go get him!

15:28.160 --> 15:29.200
Alright!

15:32.700 --> 15:35.690
When he showed up out of nowhere
three years ago,

15:35.990 --> 15:38.429
he was holding

15:38.430 --> 15:40.530
a somewhat strange tulip pot.

15:40.890 --> 15:42.979
His eyesight wasn't very good at the time,

15:42.980 --> 15:44.510
and I was worried about him.

15:50.230 --> 15:51.140
Are you okay?

15:51.870 --> 15:52.950
Where are we?

15:53.690 --> 15:54.330
Ah?

15:56.860 --> 15:57.730
Could it be...

15:57.880 --> 15:58.900
from that time...

15:59.480 --> 16:00.719
It'll still be a while.

16:00.720 --> 16:02.100
Hang in there.

16:09.640 --> 16:10.530
There he is.

16:23.030 --> 16:24.140
Skinner.

16:26.420 --> 16:27.630
Hersch.

16:28.880 --> 16:31.090
I wish I could see you one last time,

16:32.130 --> 16:33.020
but my eyes

16:33.190 --> 16:35.500
can barely see anymore.

16:38.820 --> 16:41.800
Why haven't you taken the cure?

16:42.200 --> 16:45.179
Are you planning to take responsibility
by killing yourself?

16:45.180 --> 16:46.559
The life of one man

16:46.560 --> 16:48.279
versus the human race?

16:48.280 --> 16:50.200
That doesn't add up.

16:52.880 --> 16:53.740
I know.

16:55.320 --> 16:57.440
I lost this game of hide-and-seek.

16:58.020 --> 16:59.279
As promised,

16:59.280 --> 17:01.749
the world is yours now.

17:01.750 --> 17:03.100
Where's the cure?

17:17.220 --> 17:18.409
Why

17:18.410 --> 17:20.640
did you leave without saying anything?

17:21.240 --> 17:22.369
Because I couldn't

17:22.839 --> 17:25.170
take you with me.

17:25.560 --> 17:26.560
I...

17:27.640 --> 17:29.040
would have gone with you.

17:29.960 --> 17:30.780
Ah...

17:32.820 --> 17:33.890
At that time,

17:34.270 --> 17:36.480
my heart had already died.

18:13.010 --> 18:14.040
At that time,

18:14.570 --> 18:17.190
I was lost.

18:17.800 --> 18:19.120
I doubted

18:19.390 --> 18:21.310
that there was any value

18:21.510 --> 18:24.310
in continuing to live
for myself and for humanity.

18:26.840 --> 18:28.240
I...

18:29.290 --> 18:31.499
maybe I just didn't want you all

18:31.500 --> 18:34.610
to see me like this.

18:36.730 --> 18:38.409
That's not true.

18:38.410 --> 18:39.980
You

18:40.670 --> 18:43.140
are the Skinner I know.

18:44.840 --> 18:46.809
Mr. Skinner,

18:46.810 --> 18:48.580
can I ask you something?

18:50.060 --> 18:51.370
This voice...

18:51.680 --> 18:54.740
You're one of the young men
at Billinda's place, right?

18:55.010 --> 18:57.790
Are you truly glad we found you?

18:58.930 --> 18:59.890
Or

19:00.150 --> 19:02.940
would you rather humanity be destroyed?

19:05.720 --> 19:09.090
What do you think of this world?

19:11.180 --> 19:13.330
Although this is a terrible world,

19:14.100 --> 19:16.370
it shouldn't be abandoned like this.

19:40.240 --> 19:42.600
Actually, I didn't want to do this.

19:42.830 --> 19:45.359
They're going to eliminate us because we

19:45.360 --> 19:47.200
know too many secrets, right?

19:47.310 --> 19:48.559
Leland

19:48.560 --> 19:50.460
told me everything.

19:50.570 --> 19:53.670
Including the part about us being watched.

19:56.030 --> 19:56.959
Indeed,

19:56.960 --> 19:59.670
that was the initial order.

20:00.250 --> 20:01.040
But...

20:01.530 --> 20:04.300
The President just gave the word.

20:07.720 --> 20:09.149
All you Lazarus members,

20:09.150 --> 20:10.909
for your merit in protecting Skinner

20:10.910 --> 20:12.859
and preventing the Army

20:12.860 --> 20:15.250
from developing biological weapons,

20:15.500 --> 20:17.890
are hereby granted freedom.

20:18.610 --> 20:22.890
All of your past criminal records
are erased.

20:23.260 --> 20:25.490
You are now completely free.

20:26.280 --> 20:27.740
Therefore, I propose!

20:28.220 --> 20:30.769
I feel it's such a waste to

20:30.770 --> 20:32.339
disband such an excellent team.

20:32.340 --> 20:35.420
The world still has many
unresolved issues.

20:35.590 --> 20:37.509
Would you consider

20:37.510 --> 20:38.819
reforming Lazarus

20:38.820 --> 20:40.470
to help fix them?

20:40.810 --> 20:41.849
Of course,

20:41.850 --> 20:43.449
joining or not

20:43.450 --> 20:44.870
is your choice.

20:46.470 --> 20:47.689
Well...

20:47.690 --> 20:49.010
I want to join!

20:50.120 --> 20:52.239
I've got nowhere else to go, anyway.

20:52.240 --> 20:53.819
Joining doesn't sound so bad.

20:53.820 --> 20:54.849
Me too.

20:54.850 --> 20:56.640
Please let me join.

20:56.870 --> 20:59.400
Me too. Please let me join.

21:02.230 --> 21:03.210
As for me...

21:05.330 --> 21:07.960
I just haven't had enough fun yet.

21:26.680 --> 21:30.040
[Hapna Cure Rapidly Distributed Worldwide]

21:59.210 --> 22:01.239
[Dow Jones Industrial Average]

22:01.240 --> 22:04.670
[Global Hero: Officer Mansell]

23:07.090 --> 23:10.950
[On Thin Ice: Military Build-Up
Intensifies Around Arctic Ocean]

23:14.120 --> 23:18.010
[Goodbye Hapna; Welcome Pain!!]

23:27.720 --> 23:30.580
[Deniz Skinner]

23:41.960 --> 23:45.590
[Rest in peace, Keiko Nobumoto]

23:45.960 --> 23:49.959
[0 Days Left For Us.]

23:49.960 --> 23:54.050
[LAZARUS]
